        <img class="deo-logo" src="https://t3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?client=SOCIAL&amp;type=FAVICON&amp;fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL&amp;size=64&amp;url=https://yesim.app" alt="Yesim" loading="lazy">
        <div><div class="deo-name">Yesim</div><div class="deo-sub">Onbeperkte dagbundels</div></div>
      </div>
      <p class="deo-txt">Zwitserse aanbieder met onbeperkte dagbundels en hotspot. Handig bij langere reizen of meerdere landen.</p>
      <span class="deo-cta alt">Bekijk bundels &rarr;</span>
    </a>

    <a class="deo-card" href="https://go.saily.site/aff_c?offer_id=101&amp;aff_id=15162" target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener">
      <div class="deo-head">
        <img class="deo-logo" src="https://t3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?client=SOCIAL&amp;type=FAVICON&amp;fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL&amp;size=64&amp;url=https://saily.com" alt="Saily" loading="lazy">
        <div><div class="deo-name">Saily</div><div class="deo-sub">Van de makers van NordVPN</div></div>
      </div>
      <p class="deo-txt">Scherp geprijsd met een prettige app. Vaak voordelig bij grotere databundels.</p>
      <span class="deo-cta alt">Bekijk bundels &rarr;</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="deo-dest">
    <h3>{{ section.settings.dest_heading }}</h3>
    <p>{{ section.settings.dest_sub }}</p>
    <div class="deo-chips">
      <a class="deo-chip" href="/pages/internet-op-vakantie?land=TR">&#127481;&#127479; Turkije</a>
      <a class="deo-chip" href="/pages/internet-op-vakantie?land=MA">&#127474;&#127462; Marokko</a>
